{"t":"CRWD","made":"2026-11-07 10:12","name":"CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc.","ko":"크라우드스트라이크","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":11706,"hq":"Austin, TX, United States","website":"https://www.crowdstrike.com","summary_en":"CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc. provides cybersecurity solutions in the United States and internationally. Its unified platform provides cloud-delivered protection of endpoints, cloud workloads, identity, and data through a software as a service (SaaS) subscription-based model. The company offers corporate endpoint and cloud workload security, managed security, security and vulnerability management, IT operations management, identity protection, threat intelligence, data protection, SaaS security posture management, and AI powered workflow automation, and securing generative AI workload services, as well as security orchestration, automation, and response; and security information and event management, and log management services. It primarily sells subscriptions to its Falcon platform and cloud modules. The company has a strategic alliance with Cognizant Technology Solutions Corporation to help enterprises secure artificial intelligence across its lifecycle, from the AI agents and models to the foundational infrastructure that supports the entire AI ecosystem and with Snowflake to bring AI-native security and enterprise data at scale. Additionally, it has a partnership with Fortanix Inc. to combine its Falcon platform with Fortanix Confidential AI to provide an integrated solution for end-to-end AI security. The company was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Austin, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc.는 미국 및 국제적으로 사이버 보안 솔루션을 제공합니다. 통합 플랫폼은 SaaS(Software as a Service) 구독 기반 모델을 통해 엔드포인트, 클라우드 워크로드, ID 및 데이터에 대한 클라우드 제공 보호를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 기업 엔드포인트 및 클라우드 워크로드 보안, 관리형 보안, 보안 및 취약성 관리, IT 운영 관리, ID 보호, 위협 인텔리전스, 데이터 보호, SaaS 보안 상태 관리, AI 기반 워크플로 자동화, 생성적 AI 워크로드 서비스 보안, 보안 조정, 자동화 및 대응을 제공합니다. 보안 정보 및 이벤트 관리, 로그 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 주로 Falcon 플랫폼 및 클라우드 모듈에 대한 구독을 판매합니다. 이 회사는 Cognizant Technology Solutions Corporation과 전략적 제휴를 맺어 기업이 AI 에이전트 및 모델부터 전체 AI 생태계를 지원하는 기본 인프라에 이르기까지 수명주기 전반에 걸쳐 인공 지능을 보호하고 Snowflake를 통해 AI 기반 보안 및 엔터프라이즈 데이터를 대규모로 가져올 수 있도록 지원합니다. 또한 Fortanix Inc.와 파트너십을 맺고 Falcon 플랫폼을 Fortanix Confidential AI와 결합하여 엔드투엔드 AI 보안을 위한 통합 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2011년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 오스틴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":216.9,"mcap":222091460608.0,"pe":4338.0,"fpe":134.67867,"peg":5.6052,"ps":41.15743,"pb":43.527996,"ev_ebitda":2039.431,"div":0.0,"beta":1.15,"hi52":286.99,"lo52":85.68},"fin":{"rev":5396145152.0,"rev_g":0.258,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.75185996,"op":-0.02259,"net":0.00834,"roe":0.01461,"fcf":1995385472.0,"cash":5013847040.0,"debt":820179008.0,"de":15.958,"eps":0.05,"feps":1.6105},"own":{"short":0.0238,"inst":0.77516997,"insider":0.013359999},"analyst":{"n":50,"mean":248.45,"median":250.0,"high":325.0,"low":132.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.66038,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":10,"buy":31,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":10,"buy":30,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":10,"buy":30,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":10,"buy":30,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Deutsche Bank","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":300.0,"priorPriceTarget":240.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"Mizuho","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":275.0,"priorPriceTarget":250.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":265.0,"priorPriceTarget":245.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","p